# Live user data. buschain.db is the app's default DB and holds the
# dispatcher's real plan — never commit it, and never point an experiment at
# it (pass a scratch path to create_app instead). The -shm/-wal siblings are
# SQLite's WAL files for the same database.
buschain.db
buschain.db-shm
buschain.db-wal
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# The reference workbook. Deliberately untracked for now: the only copy on
# this machine (LDC_PLANNER__test-FINAL.xlsx) already carries the
# Nationality/OP pick-list columns in Information!O and !P, so it is a
# POST-export workbook, not the golden fixture tests/conftest.py:30 describes
# as predating them. Committing it would pin AT1's byte-identity tripwire to a
# derived artifact. Drop the real LDC_PLANNER__test.xlsx here and remove this
# block to track it.
LDC_PLANNER__test.xlsx
LDC_PLANNER__test-FINAL.xlsx

